===International players===
For the third time in NBA history, an international player would enter the NBA draft. This draft would also be the first time a foreign player entering the NBA draft would not come from the [[Eastern Bloc]], but instead represent [[Africa]] while playing in [[Europe]]. The following international player successfully applied for early draft entrance.<ref name=tdr />

* {{flagicon|SEN}} Etienne Preira – F, [[ADA Blois Basket 41|ADA Blois]] ([[LNB Pro B|France]])

